<title>PORTUGAL: Cimpor OPV four times oversubscribed.</title>
<headline>Cimpor OPV four times oversubscribed.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The public offer to sell (OPV) in the privatisation of a 45 percent stake in Portuguese cement group Cimpor-Cimentos de Portugal was more than four times oversubscribed, officials said.</p>
<p>They said at a special session at Lisbon bourse to give details of the sale that total demand for 78.8 million shares comfortably outstripped the available 17.2 million shares in the OPV.</p>
<p>The government earned 50.2 billion escudos from the OPV, the officials said.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
